{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSVD"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Computes an approximate rank-k SVD of an M×N matrix A:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A ≈ U * diag(S) * Vᵀ"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"where U is M×k orthonormal, S is k-vector of singular values, Vᵀ is k×N.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Complexity","anchor":"Complexity","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(M·N·k) — dramatically faster than full "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dgesdd_"},{"type":"text","text":" O(M·N²) when k ≪ min(M, N)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Algorithm (Halko 2011)","anchor":"Algorithm-Halko-2011","type":"heading","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Draw random Gaussian matrix Ω ∈ ℝ^{N×(k+p)}  (p=10 oversampling)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Compute range sketch Y = A·Ω  via BLAS dgemm."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orthonormalize Y via thin QR (dgeqrf + dorgqr)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Project B = Qᵀ·A  (small k×N matrix)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Compute small exact SVD of B with dgesdd_."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Back-project left singular vectors: U = Q·Ũ.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Reference","text":"Reference","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Halko N., Martinsson P.G., Tropp J.A. (2011). Finding Structure with Randomness:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Probabilistic Algorithms for Constructing Approximate Matrix Decompositions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SIAM Review 53(2):217–288."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/randomizedsvd"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RandomizedSVD","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"RandomizedSVD","roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RandomizedSVD","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:12SwiftCluster13RandomizedSVDO","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SwiftCluster"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Randomized Singular Value Decomposition using the Halko et al. (2011) algorithm."}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD\/Result"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD\/compute(X:nComponents:nOversamples:nPowerIter:seed:)"],"anchor":"Type-Methods"}],"references":{"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster":{"role":"collection","title":"SwiftCluster","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"PCA Dimensionality Reduction & Unsupervised Clustering."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/RandomizedSVD":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSVD"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/randomized